			<div id="post-32661" class="post-32661 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-discourse-net">
			<h2 class="entry-title"><a href="https://www.discourse.net/2023/09/are-you-kidding-me/" title="Permalink to Are You Kidding Me?" rel="bookmark">Are You Kidding Me?</a></h2>

			<div class="entry-meta">
				<span class="meta-prep meta-prep-author">Posted on</span> <a href="https://www.discourse.net/2023/09/are-you-kidding-me/" title="4:12 pm" rel="bookmark"><span class="entry-date">September 18, 2023</span></a> <span class="meta-sep">by</span> <span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://www.discourse.net/author/michael/" title="View all posts by Michael Froomkin">Michael Froomkin</a></span>			</div><!-- .entry-meta -->

				<div class="entry-content">
				<p>Apparently, Twitter&#8211;excuse me, X&#8211;thinks there&#8217;s something potentially dirty <a href="https://www.discourse.net/2023/09/an-affair-of-the-heart/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a>.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.discourse.net/site/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/x-shot.jpg"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-attachment-id="32662" data-permalink="https://www.discourse.net/2023/09/are-you-kidding-me/x-shot/" data-orig-file="https://www.discourse.net/site/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/x-shot.jpg" data-orig-size="626,409" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}" data-image-title="x-shot" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://www.discourse.net/site/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/x-shot-400x261.jpg" class="alignright size-full wp-image-32662" src="https://www.discourse.net/site/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/x-shot.jpg" alt="" width="626" height="409" srcset="https://www.discourse.net/site/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/x-shot.jpg 626w, https://www.discourse.net/site/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/x-shot-250x163.jpg 250w, https://www.discourse.net/site/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/x-shot-400x261.jpg 400w, https://www.discourse.net/site/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/x-shot-150x98.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 626px) 100vw, 626px" /></a></p>
							</div><!-- .entry-content -->
	
			<div class="entry-utility">
									<span class="cat-links">
						<span class="entry-utility-prep entry-utility-prep-cat-links">Posted in</span> <a href="https://www.discourse.net/category/discourse-net/" rel="category tag">Discourse.net</a>					</span>
					<span class="meta-sep">|</span>
